 Ocean Freight from China to Australia"},{"id":"3-australian-destination-charges","heading":"3. Australian Destination Charges"},{"id":"4-australian-customs-duty-and-gst","heading":"4. Australian Customs Duty and GST"},{"id":"5-australian-biosecurity-requirements","heading":"5. Australian Biosecurity Requirements"},{"id":"6-main-40hq-shipping-routes-from-china-to-australia","heading":"6. Main 40HQ Shipping Routes from China to Australia"},{"id":"7-how-long-does-a-40hq-take-from-china-to-australia","heading":"7. How Long Does a 40HQ Take from China to Australia?"},{"id":"8-example-of-a-complete-40hq-logistics-chain","heading":"8. Example of a Complete 40HQ Logistics Chain"},{"id":"9-how-to-reduce-40hq-shipping-costs","heading":"9. How to Reduce 40HQ Shipping Costs"},{"id":"10-40hq-vs-lcl-which-is-better","heading":"10. 40HQ vs LCL: Which Is Better?"},{"id":"11-what-information-is-needed-for-an-accurate-40hq-quote","heading":"11. What Information Is Needed for an Accurate 40HQ Quote?"},{"id":"frequently-asked-questions","heading":"Frequently Asked Questions"},{"id":"get-a-40hq-shipping-quote-from-china-to-australia","heading":"Get a 40HQ Shipping Quote from China to Australia"}],"wordCount":1690,"titleZh":"中国到澳大利亚一个 40HQ 集装箱的运输成本","descriptionZh":"了解 40HQ 海运、起运港和目的港费用、清关与派送成本。","readingMinutes":8}}]]
